ption for a new tool launch on Toolbit, along with premium options for teams seeking a more prominent launch presence.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>I'd be happy to walk you through what's available and help figure out the right approach for <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{tool_name}}</strong>'s launch.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Would you be interested in exploring a launch on Toolbit?</p><div style='margin: 24px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Best regards,<br>Toolbit AI<br>Toolbit.ai<br><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' style='color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;' target='_blank'>https://www.toolbit.ai/</a></div></td></tr><tr><td align='center' style='padding: 24px 24px 28px 24px; background-color: #fcfbfa; border-top: 1px solid #f4f4f5; text-align: center;' class='mobile-padding'><p style='margin: 0 0 0 0 !important; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px !important; color: #52525b !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; text-align: center;'>You received this email regarding AI tool discovery and opportunities on Toolbit.ai.</p><p style='margin: 4px 0 12px 0 !important; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px !important; color: #a1a1aa !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; text-align: center;'>Feel free to reply this mail or reach out to us at <a href='mailto:contact@toolbit.ai' style='color: #71717a !important; text-decoration: underline !important; font-weight: 500 !important;'>contact@toolbit.ai</a>.</p><div style='margin-bottom: 12px;'><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' style='color: #71717a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 6px;' target='_blank'>Home</a> &middot; <a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/contact' style='color: #71717a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 6px;' target='_blank'>Contact</a></div><p style='margin: 0 !important; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px !important; color: #94a3b8 !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; text-align: center;'>&copy; 2026 Toolbit AI. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
      "text": "Hi {{recipient_name}},\n\nI'm reaching out from Toolbit.ai, a platform where users actively search for and discover AI tools across a wide range of categories.\n\nI came across **{{tool_name}}** and noticed you're preparing for launch - congratulations on reaching this stage. Toolbit can be a strong place to get **{{tool_name}}** in front of an audience that's actively looking for new AI solutions around the time of launch.\n\nWe offer a no-cost option for a new tool launch on Toolbit, along with premium options for teams seeking a more prominent launch presence.\n\nI'd be happy to walk you through what's available and help figure out the right approach for **{{tool_name}}**'s launch.\n\nWould you be interested in exploring a launch on Toolbit?\n\nBest regards,\nToolbit AI\nToolbit.ai\nhttps://www.toolbit.ai/",
      "variables": ["{{recipient_name}}", "{{tool_name}}"],
      "created_at": "2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-29T12:30:00.000Z"
    },
    "affiliate_partnership": {
