      "from_name": "Toolbit AI",
      "from_email": "team@mail.toolbit.ai",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN' 'http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd'><html xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml' lang='en'><head><meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' /><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' /><meta http-equiv='X-UA-Compatible' content='IE=edge' /><title>Affiliate Partnership: Toolbit x {{company_name}}</title><style type='text/css'>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }body { height: 100% !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; background-color: #f9f8f6; font-family: 'Figtree', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }p { margin: 0 0 18px 0 !important; line-height: 1.65 !important; color: #3f3f46 !important; font-size: 15px !important; }strong { color: #18181b !important; font-weight: 600 !important; }a { color: #0d9488 !important; text-decoration: underline !important; font-weight: 500 !important; }ul, ol { margin: 0 0 20px 0 !important; padding-left: 24px !important; line-height: 1.65 !important; color: #3f3f46 !important; }li { margin-bottom: 8px !important; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { .responsive-table { width: 100% !important; } .mobile-padding { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; } }</style></head><body style='margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f9f8f6;'><table role='presentation' border='0' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' width='100%' style='background-color: #f9f8f6; width: 100%;'><tr><td align='center' style='padding: 32px 16px;'><table role='presentation' border='0' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' width='100%' class='responsive-table' style='max-width: 580px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e4e2db; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);'><tr><td style='padding: 32px 32px 20px 32px; background-color: #fcfbfa; border-bottom: 1px solid #f4f4f5; text-align: left;' class='mobile-padding'><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' target='_blank' style='text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;'><img src='https://www.toolbit.ai/logo-icon.png' alt='Toolbit.ai Logo' width='28' height='28' style='display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px; width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 0;' /><span style='display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: #0d9488;'>Toolbit.ai</span></a></td></tr><tr><td style='padding: 32px 32px 28px 32px; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46;' class='mobile-padding'><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Hi {{recipient_name}},</p><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>I'm reaching out from Toolbit.ai, a growing AI tools discovery platform helping users search, compare, and find the relevant AI tools based on their needs and use cases.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>We came across <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{tool_name}}</strong> and think it'd genuinely resonate with our audience. Rather than a standard directory listing, we'd love to explore an affiliate partnership with <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{company_name}}</strong> - where we actively promote <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{tool_name}}</strong> to our users, and earn a commission on the signups/purchases we drive.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Could you let us know:</p><ol style='margin: 0 0 20px 0; padding-left: 24px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46;'><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Does <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{company_name}}</strong> currently have an affiliate or referral program?</li><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>If yes, could you share the signup link along with the commission structure and cookie duration?</li></ol><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>If you don't currently have a program in place, we'd also be glad to discuss setting up a direct referral partnership instead.</p><p style='margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>If this moves forward, next steps on our end would be:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 20px 0; padding-left: 24px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46;'><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Getting set up with your tracking link.</li><li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Featuring <strong style='color: #18181b; font-weight: 600;'>{{tool_name}}</strong> on relevant category pages, with visibility on our homepage or other high-traffic pages as opportunities arise.</li></ul><p style='margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Would love to hear your thoughts whenever convenient.</p><div style='margin: 24px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.65; color: #3f3f46; font-size: 15px;'>Best regards,<br>Toolbit AI<br>Toolbit.ai<br><a href='https://www.toolbit.ai/' style='color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;' target='_blank'>https://www.toolbit.ai/</a></div></td></tr><tr><td align='center' style='padding: 24px 24px 28px 24px; background-color: #fcfbfa; border-top: 1px solid #f4f4f5; text-align: center;' class='mobile-padding'><p style='margin: 0 0 0 0 !important; font-family: Figtree, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;