      "text": "Hi {{recipient_name}},\n\nI'm reaching out from Toolbit.ai, a growing AI tools discovery platform helping users search, compare, and find the relevant AI tools based on their needs and use cases.\n\nWe came across **{{tool_name}}** and think it'd genuinely resonate with our audience. Rather than a standard directory listing, we'd love to explore an affiliate partnership with **{{company_name}}** - where we actively promote **{{tool_name}}** to our users, and earn a commission on the signups/purchases we drive.\n\nCould you let us know:\n\n1. Does **{{company_name}}** currently have an affiliate or referral program?\n2. If yes, could you share the signup link along with the commission structure and cookie duration?\n\nIf you don't currently have a program in place, we'd also be glad to discuss setting up a direct referral partnership instead.\n\nIf this moves forward, next steps on our end would be:\n\n- Getting set up with your tracking link.\n- Featuring **{{tool_name}}** on relevant category pages, with visibility on our homepage or other high-traffic pages as opportunities arise.\n\nWould love to hear your thoughts whenever convenient.\n\nBest regards,\nToolbit AI\nToolbit.ai\nhttps://www.toolbit.ai/",
      "variables": ["{{recipient_name}}", "{{tool_name}}", "{{company_name}}"],
