      "text": "Hey **{{first_name}}**,\n\nWant more people to find **{{tool_name}}**? Toolbit.ai is a platform where people discover and compare AI tools, and we'd love to list your tool.\n\nListing is free (with launch badge verification), and takes just a couple of minutes.\n\nIf you want **{{tool_name}} ({{tool_domain}})** to get more benefits and stand out from day one, our Paid Launch Plan includes:\n\n✓ Review within **24 hours** (skip the standard queue)\n✓ **Featured placement** on the sidebar\n✓ **Blue Verified Tick** on your listing\n✓ Permanent directory placement with a **do-follow backlink**\n✓ A dedicated **X/Twitter post** featuring your tool\n\n👉 See pricing and submit here: https://www.toolbit.ai/submit\n\nHave something more specific in mind – a featured ads placement, or a custom listing package? Just reply, happy to work something out.\n\nBest,\nToolbit AI\nhttps://www.toolbit.ai/",
